flowchart TB
  U([Timetable officer / student / faculty]) --> I
  subgraph I[Interface layer]
    D[Web dashboard<br/>Overview · Timetable · Agent Studio · System · Quality · Results]
    C[CLI: chat, run_demo, solve]
    R[REST API /docs]
  end
  I --> A
  subgraph A[Agent layer: LangGraph StateGraph, 11 nodes]
    SUP[Supervisor] --> REQ[Requirements] --> SCH[Scheduler] --> VAL[Validator]
    VAL --> DIA[Diagnoser] --> REP[Repairer] --> VAL
    VAL --> APP{{Approval gate}} --> EXP[Explainer]
    SUP --> ACT[Action agent] --> EXP
    SUP --> AST[ReAct assistant]
  end
  A -- MCP JSON-RPC over stdio --> M
  subgraph M[MCP layer: 4 servers, 30 tools]
    M1[data · 3] --- M2[academic · 4] --- M3[resource · 8] --- M4[timetable · 15]
  end
  M --> E
  subgraph E[Engine layer: deterministic, no LLM]
    E1[Decomposed CP-SAT] --- E2[LNS repair] --- E3[Validator H1-H9] --- E4[Diagnosis & capacity proof] --- E5[VBA baseline]
  end
  E --> S[(SQLite store<br/>versions · pins · audit · memory)]
  E --> X[(Master_TimeTable .xlsm)]
